# Image paths deleted after our sparse/ tree has been overlaid, one per line.
# droid-configs.inc applies this last, so it is the sanctioned way to drop a
# file that comes from the droid-hal-configs submodule.
#
# Because it runs *after* the overlay, anything listed here is removed even if
# our own sparse/ provides it. /etc/ofono/binder.conf used to be listed, from
# when this port ran the legacy grilio stack and configured both slots in
# ril_subscription.conf; that entry silently deleted our own binder.conf once
# we moved to ofono-binder-plugin. Do not re-add a path here that sparse/ is
# meant to ship.
